    "content": "<p>Pick up those tools, Pilots. If you want to grind the enemy into cosmic dust, you&rsquo;ll need a War Robot to do it in. From Modules to Gear, Classes, Weapons, and Titans, there&rsquo;s a few things you&rsquo;ll need to balance, but you&rsquo;re more than up to the task.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Learn everything you need to know about constructing and customizing your War Robots in this new video.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"embeddedContent oembed-provider-youtube\" data-align=\"center\" data-oembed=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SSD6822uQAg\" data-oembed_provider=\"youtube\" data-resizetype=\"noresize\" style=\"text-align:center\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"true\" allowscriptaccess=\"always\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/SSD6822uQAg?wmode=transparent&amp;jqoemcache=tuxmX\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<p>Discover more videos from the War Robots: Frontiers universe over on our <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@WRFrontiers\">official YouTube channel</a>!</p>",
